<title>USA: Geron gets Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn investment.</title>
<headline>Geron gets Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn investment.</headline>
<dateline>MENLO PARK, Calif. 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Geron Corp said on Monday it signed a collaboration agreement with Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn Inc which includes a $2 million equity investment by Pharmacia in Geron.</p>
<p>The company said the collaboration would focus on the discovery, development and commercialization of a new class of anticancer drugs.</p>
<p>The companies signed a non-binding heads of agreement which states that they will use their &quot;best efforts&quot; to complete negotiations of a definitive agreement, Geron said.</p>
</text>
